      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Before 1888, Buena Vista was known as Hart's Bottom, Green Forest, and Green Valley.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buena_Vista%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town’s first industry was a simple tannery at the railroad and canal intersection, later adding a pulp mill and canning factory.",
